Capturing the Friedmans is a documentary, crime film directed by Andrew Jarecki.

3
00:20:03,750 --> 00:20:09,750
An Oscar nominated documentary about a middle-class American family who is torn apart when the
father Arnold and son Jesse are accused of sexually abusing numerous children.

4
00:26:45,000 --> 00:26:51,000
Director Jarecki interviews people from different sides of this tragic story and raises the question of whether they
were rightfully tried when they claim they were innocent and there was never any evidence against them.

