01:13:33,750 --> 01:13:39,750
Capturing the Friedmans is a 2003 HBO documentary
film directed by Andrew Jarecki.

12
01:20:15,000 --> 01:20:21,000
It focuses on the 1980s investigation of Arnold and
Jesse Friedman for child molestation.

13
01:26:56,250 --> 01:27:02,250
The film premiered at the 2003 Sundance Film Festival where it received
critical acclaim as well as the Grand Jury Prize: Documentary.

14
01:33:37,500 --> 01:33:43,500
The film went on to be nominated for the Academy
Award for Best Documentary Feature.

15
